    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 78,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "When you be back?"
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 1,
        "line": 1025,
        "text": "I know. Maybe that makes us tough. Rich fellas come up an' they die, an' their kids ain't no good, an' they die out. But we keep a-comin'. We're the people that live. Can't nobody wipe us out. Can't nobody lick us. We'll go on forever, Pa. We're the people."
      }
